      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Why, hello. Would you be open to assisting a\nmaster perfumer in her quest?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I make my delightful fragrances using the scents\nproduced by Spritzee.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You see, the aroma of each Spritzee can differ in\ntantalizing ways, based on the diet they consume.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d like to see how a Berry-forward diet will affect\nthe aroma of my Spritzee here.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ideally I’d like to try feeding Spritzee 20 Cheri\nBerries, 5 Tamato Berries, and 5 Occa Berries.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zee?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A00650065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But surely you see my conundrum.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200073007500720065006C007900200079006F007500200073006500650020006D007900200063006F006E0075006E006400720075006D002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t spend too long wandering the city streets.\nThe competing odors that waft about would ruin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmy nose, making me insensible to good smells!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 151
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I’d like to ask you to please get the Berries in\nmy stead!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200049201900640020006C0069006B006500200074006F002000610073006B00200079006F007500200074006F00200070006C0065006100730065002000670065007400200074006800650020004200650072007200690065007300200069006E000A006D00790020007300740065006100640021001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It would be wonderful if you collected Berries\naround town for me—you could even buy them!<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nI’m not particularly fussy about how you do it!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 146
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just be sure to get me 20 Cheri Berries, 5 Tamato\nBerries, and 5 Occa Berries.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zeeee?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0065006500650065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Get me 20 Cheri Berries, 5 Tamato Berries, and\n5 Occa Berries. Off you trot.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, wonderful. You’re here with my 20 Cheri\nBerries, 5 Tamato Berries, and 5 Occa Berries.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Having this many Berries will allow for a rich\ncomplexity in the aroma Spritzee produces.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And since all of these Berries have a spicy flavor,\nthis new perfume should have quite the kick.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SPRRRIIIIIIT!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053005000520052005200490049004900490049004900540021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What is it, Spritzee? Is something bothering you?\nI can’t imagine what.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Don’t tell me this is too many Berries for you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E20190074002000740065006C006C0020006D00650020007400680069007300200069007300200074006F006F0020006D0061006E00790020004200650072007200690065007300200066006F007200200079006F0075003F001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sprrriiit!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530070007200720072006900690069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But don’t you want to explore all the wondrous\naromas your body can produce?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Spritzeeeeee!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530070007200690074007A0065006500650065006500650021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see! Yes, I understand you perfectly, my friend.\nWe just need to find a way for you to eat all these<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nBerries without getting overwhelmed!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know, Lumiose used to have a famous Juice\nShoppe...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006B006E006F0077002C0020004C0075006D0069006F007300650020007500730065006400200074006F0020006800610076006500200061002000660061006D006F007500730020004A0075006900630065000A00530068006F007000700065002E002E002E001000020114017E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If I can find a former employee of that shop, they\nshould be able to whip these Cheri Berries into a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ntasty Red Juice for Spritzee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zeee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A00650065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks to you, I now know what I need to create a\nwhole flurry of new fragrances!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSo take a little something from me in return—\nsome sprigs of Modest Mint and an Exp. Candy.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Zee zee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A006500650020007A0065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thanks to you, I now know what I need to create a\nwhole flurry of new fragrances!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPerhaps my former apprentice, Odette, will see\nthat my skill is still nothing to be sniffed at!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕž",
